Synchronize multiple directories (buckets) using rsync.

If no bucket names are provided, all buckets defined in the configuration are synced.
rsync output is logged to a file if 'log_dir' is configured in the YAML file.

Usage:
  synq [flags] [bucket1 bucket2 ...]

Flags:
  -c, --config string   Path to the configuration file (default "/root/.synq/synq.yml")
  -n, --dry-run         Run in dry-run mode
  -h, --help            help for synq
  -r, --reverse         Reverse sync (destination becomes source)
  -v, --verbose         Enable verbose output
      --version         version for synq
  -y, --yes             Skip confirmation prompt
